00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:15,054
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako!</font>

4
00:01:17,473 --> 00:01:20,101
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I got it!</font>

5
00:01:21,102 --> 00:01:22,019
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako!</font>

6
00:01:28,150 --> 00:01:29,068
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako, hi!</font>

7
00:01:32,947 --> 00:01:35,324
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Do your best!
