9
00:01:44,458 --> 00:01:48,212
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- quickly, like this.
- I see. Uh-huh.</font>

10
00:01:49,255 --> 00:01:52,424
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Listen, this is big. Obviously, the
