16
00:02:06,981 --> 00:02:09,024
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako!</font>

17
00:02:09,108 --> 00:02:09,984
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hm?
- Hm?</font>

18
00:02:17,324 --> 00:02:21,036
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You lower your hips down, kinda like
this. Then, you take the inner side of</font>

19
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:24,790
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">your foot and try to gouge the ball
precisely and with all your might...</font>

20
00:02:24,874 --> 00:02:27,877
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...you push it out! Push it out!
Push it out! Push it out! Push it out!</font>

21
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:31,046
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I get it. -Push it out! Once more...
- Sawako!</font>

22
00:02:32,882 --> 00:02:33,799
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">See ya!</font>

23
00:02:35,384 --> 00:02:36,302
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bye-bye.</font>

24
00:02:38,304 --> 00:02:40,055
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What?
- I made friends with her.</font>

25
00:02:40,139 --> 00:02:41,891
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No way!</font>

26
00:02:44,101 --> 00:02:48,606
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Come on! She for real?!
- Well, I think it's fairly obvious</font>

27
00:02:48,689 --> 00:02:51,400
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">that you don't like her very much.</font>

28
00:02:51,483 --> 00:02:54,528
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">How can you tell, Yano-chin?</font>

29
00:02:54,612 --> 00:02:56,071
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Cause you're simple.</font>

30
00:02:56,155 --> 00:02:58,866
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, I mean it's good that
Sadako's making more friends, but...</font>

31
00:02:58,949 --> 00:03:01,702
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Really? Friends?</font>

32
00:03:03,495 --> 00:03:06,165
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bye-bye... Bye-bye... Bye-bye...</font>

33
00:03:06,248 --> 00:03:09,960
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What if she ends up closer to her
