34
00:03:10,044 --> 00:03:13,797
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Aw, you're adorable,
you know that, Chizu?</font>

35
00:03:15,716 --> 00:03:20,054
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Another one. I can't believe
I made another new friend.</font>

36
00:03:21,639 --> 00:03:27,311
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To be honest, I didn't exactly work
for it, so it hasn't really sunk in.</font>

37
00:03:29,730 --> 00:03:35,527
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, we're friends... I mean,
obviously we are, aren't we?</font>

38
00:03:39,281 --> 00:03:42,326
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm new to this, but I wonder if making
new friends... is supposed to feel like</font>

39
00:03:42,409 --> 00:03:45,496
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">this?</font>

40
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:55,172
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I haven't had much time to process
it but I know it makes me happy.</font>

41
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:00,177
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ku-ro-numa!</font>

42
00:04:00,803 --> 00:04:05,224
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">W- Why did... Kazehaya's face just pop up?!</font>

43
00:04:05,307 --> 00:04:11,605
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He had nothing to do with what I was just
thinking about! I can't fall asleep now!</font>

44
00:04:19,780 --> 00:04:24,118
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I still can't believe Kurumi chose to
be my friend. I've been so lucky lately...</font>

45
00:04:24,201 --> 00:04:28,580
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Though the universe has been
finding a way to balance it out.</font>

46
00:04:37,548 --> 00:04:39,383
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Here.</font>

47
00:04:42,761 --> 00:04:44,305
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Th- Thanks for that.</font>

48
00:04:44,888 --> 00:04:45,806
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh, yeah.</font>

49
00:04:49,977 --> 00:04:53,314
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What's the deal with those two?
- Can't tell? They're</font>

50
00:04:53,397 --> 00:04:56,734
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- self-conscious. Full of nerves.
- Hmm?</font>

51
00:04:57,901 --> 00:04:59,945
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Th- This is a problem.</font>

52
00:05:01,739 --> 00:05:07,953
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">For some reason... I can't seem to have a
normal conversation with Kazehaya anymore.</font>

53
00:05:10,164 --> 00:05:13,876
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya!</font>

54
00:05:20,132 --> 00:05:21,216
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What's up?</font>

55
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:26,638
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's the committee's handout. I
was asked to deliver it to you. Here.</font>

56
00:05:26,722 --> 00:05:29,892
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, thanks! Oh yeah,
the CD! Wait here a sec.</font>

57
00:05:29,975 --> 00:05:33,312
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You brought it for me? Thank you!</font>

58
00:05:33,395 --> 00:05:36,315
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let's see... here it is!</font>

59
00:05:37,441 --> 00:05:39,234
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Here you go.
- Yay! Awesome!</font>

60
00:05:40,444 --> 00:05:41,570
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So natural!</font>

61
00:05:46,075 --> 00:05:50,412
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's super cute, and a
good person, and friendly.</font>

62
00:05:50,496 --> 00:05:53,499
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kurumi really is in a tier of her own.</font>

63
00:06:08,097 --> 00:06:09,640
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thanks for everything.</font>

64
00:06:10,265 --> 00:06:15,187
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I bet she would never have
awkward encounters like that.</font>

65
00:06:15,270 --> 00:06:20,484
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She just kinda... has this
natural way about her. Must be nice...</font>

66
00:06:20,567 --> 00:06:24,822
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako! Is something wrong?</font>

67
00:06:27,533 --> 00:06:33,789
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Woah, thank you.
- Mm-mm. It's my bad for startling you.</font>

68
00:06:35,124 --> 00:06:37,793
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I called you, but I
guess you didn't hear me.</font>

69
00:06:37,876 --> 00:06:40,546
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm sorry I should have
been paying better attention.</font>

70
00:06:40,629 --> 00:06:43,465
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Here you are.</font>

71
00:06:43,549 --> 00:06:46,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thanks so much, So, uh, I, uh...</font>

72
00:06:48,762 --> 00:06:49,680
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ku...</font>

73
00:06:50,681 --> 00:06:51,515
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">K- Kurumi.</font>

74
00:06:53,058 --> 00:06:57,479
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I- I called her by her
name. Or was that too friendly?</font>

75
00:06:59,189 --> 00:07:02,359
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's the first time you've
called me by name directly. Awesome!</font>

76
00:07:02,443 --> 00:07:05,612
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I made the right choice!</font>

77
00:07:06,572 --> 00:07:10,367
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- That's heavy right? Want me to hold half?
- No, I'm fine. This is my</font>

78
00:07:10,451 --> 00:07:13,829
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">mission and mine alone!</font>

79
00:07:13,912 --> 00:07:17,666
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Your "mission?" You're so funny, Sawako!</font>

80
00:07:17,749 --> 00:07:21,462
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Seriously. It would be so nice
if I could become more like her.</font>

81
00:07:22,713 --> 00:07:26,383
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya! I got you the
handout! Lend me your CD, will ya?</font>

82
00:07:26,467 --> 00:07:27,301
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Okay!</font>

83
00:07:28,927 --> 00:07:30,387
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Nice! Thank you!
- Yay!</font>

84
00:07:32,097 --> 00:07:34,516
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- M-Maybe that's too far.
- Sawako?</font>

85
00:07:36,059 --> 00:07:40,230
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, Is there something
that's been bothering you lately?</font>

86
00:07:40,314 --> 00:07:43,317
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Cause If there is, know you can always
talk to me! If you're comfortable telling</font>

87
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:47,779
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- me, I'll listen!
- Not really "bothering" me...</font>

88
00:07:51,783 --> 00:07:53,952
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, you can tell me anything!</font>

89
00:07:58,707 --> 00:08:02,753
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Seriously? My role model... is
offering to give me advice?</font>

90
00:08:07,466 --> 00:08:11,261
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I'm ready! Bring it on!
- Pitch to contact! Let's go!</font>

91
00:08:13,931 --> 00:08:18,101
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You can't talk naturally with Kazehaya?
- Yes, Maybe it's just "different"</font>

92
00:08:18,185 --> 00:08:21,980
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">chatting with boys than it is with girls?</font>

93
00:08:22,064 --> 00:08:26,193
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You're thinking about it too hard!
- I knew it!</font>

94
00:08:26,276 --> 00:08:29,905
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let me tell you something, coming from
someone who's known Kazehaya super well</font>

95
00:08:29,988 --> 00:08:33,617
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">since middle school...</font>

96
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:37,287
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yes? As long as I've known him, he's
never been able to leave outcasts alone.</font>

97
00:08:37,371 --> 00:08:41,250
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He talks to anyone and I mean everyone,
naturally, Even you're no exception,</font>

98
00:08:41,333 --> 00:08:45,254
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako So, I'm sure he
would talk to you the same way.</font>

99
00:08:45,337 --> 00:08:48,465
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah! You're right! That's true!</font>

100
00:08:48,549 --> 00:08:51,677
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So yeah. The way that he's been talking
to you isn't really anything out of the</font>

101
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:54,930
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">ordinary or special. -I don't think you
need to drive yourself so crazy over it.</font>

102
00:08:55,013 --> 00:08:58,225
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I see!</font>

103
00:09:02,354 --> 00:09:05,649
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah! But you should consider that you
and Kazehaya are very different types of</font>

104
00:09:05,732 --> 00:09:09,027
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}- people too.
- Uh-huh.</font>

105
00:09:09,111 --> 00:09:12,698
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So when you think about it, even if it's
another boy, rather than a cheerful person</font>

106
00:09:12,781 --> 00:09:16,410
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">like Kazehaya... ...you might find it easier
to talk to someone who's a little more</font>

107
00:09:16,493 --> 00:09:20,414
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">like you, you know?</font>

108
00:09:20,497 --> 00:09:25,085
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When it comes down to it, each person
has their own place where they belong in</font>

109
00:09:25,168 --> 00:09:29,756
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- society.
- Ah, you're teaching me so much.</font>

110
00:09:31,341 --> 00:09:34,553
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, that must be why it seems so natural
whenever I see you and Kazehaya talk to</font>

111
00:09:34,636 --> 00:09:37,848
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- each other.
- You think so?</font>

112
00:09:37,931 --> 00:09:41,143
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, Kazehaya and I do share a
lot of similar qualities, you know...</font>

113
00:09:41,226 --> 00:09:44,396
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wow!</font>

114
00:09:46,773 --> 00:09:49,151
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Now that I think about it, whenever he
talks to her, he uses her first name,</font>

115
00:09:49,234 --> 00:09:51,653
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">doesn't he?</font>

116
00:09:53,780 --> 00:09:56,450
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}You seem kinda close... to each other.</font>

117
00:09:56,533 --> 00:10:00,746
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}I wouldn't really say close. We're normal!</font>

118
00:10:01,580 --> 00:10:03,123
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wha-? That's normal?</font>

119
00:10:05,083 --> 00:10:11,089
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I didn't know the standard for
"normal" was so high! Amazing!</font>

120
00:10:13,008 --> 00:10:17,971
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm learning so much. I mean, if that's
what's normal for someone like you, it'd</font>

121
00:10:18,055 --> 00:10:20,891
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- make sense that I'd be nervous.
- Well, we should start heading back.</font>

122
00:10:20,974 --> 00:10:23,810
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Y- Yeah.</font>

123
00:10:25,562 --> 00:10:27,022
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey there, Kuronuma!</font>

124
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:32,569
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">In the beginning I
couldn't even greet him properly.</font>

125
00:10:34,321 --> 00:10:37,407
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That used to be my "normal," didn't it?</font>

126
00:10:39,493 --> 00:10:41,536
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Then it's fine.</font>

127
00:10:47,584 --> 00:10:48,502
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Um, Kurumi?</font>

128
00:10:51,171 --> 00:10:54,675
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I think after talking about all of this
with you, I'm feeling much more positive.</font>

129
00:10:54,758 --> 00:10:58,303
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you so much!</font>

130
00:10:59,930 --> 00:11:03,350
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll think of it as one step at a time!
Sure, I'll still be nervous... but I'm gonna</font>

131
00:11:03,433 --> 00:11:06,853
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- push myself!
- Wait...</font>

132
00:11:07,646 --> 00:11:08,897
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Later!</font>

133
00:11:08,980 --> 00:11:12,401
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Sawako!
- So, uh, you think if I keep working at</font>

134
00:11:12,484 --> 00:11:16,363
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">it, I could become more like you one day?</font>

135
00:11:16,446 --> 00:11:19,950
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I-I'm getting ahead of myself, no way I
could do that. I'm sorry, please forget</font>

136
00:11:20,033 --> 00:11:23,620
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">what I just said!</font>

137
00:11:37,008 --> 00:11:40,011
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kurumi is like... hmm, how do I put this?</font>

138
00:11:41,513 --> 00:11:45,976
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, this is from when we
were in middle school, but still...</font>

139
00:11:47,394 --> 00:11:48,437
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizu.</font>

140
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:49,604
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hm?</font>

141
00:11:49,688 --> 00:11:52,441
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yumi told me that she
really likes Kazehaya.</font>

142
00:11:52,524 --> 00:11:54,526
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And well... since you are so close with
him, think maybe you could help her out a</font>

143
00:11:54,609 --> 00:11:56,611
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- little?
- I don't exactly "hate" when</font>

144
00:11:56,695 --> 00:11:58,739
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">someone depends on me for something, so...</font>

145
00:12:01,783 --> 00:12:05,787
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Gotcha~ you just need me to make an
opening for them to be alone together,</font>

146
00:12:05,871 --> 00:12:09,916
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- right? That's a piece of cake!
- I knew we were right to trust you, Chizu!</font>

147
00:12:11,251 --> 00:12:15,213
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So after that. She took the chance
and asked him out, but she was rejected.</font>

148
00:12:15,297 --> 00:12:19,634
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah. And, up to that
point, it wasn't so bad...</font>

149
00:12:19,718 --> 00:12:22,012
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizu, please help her too?</font>

150
00:12:22,095 --> 00:12:23,013
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

151
00:12:26,183 --> 00:12:28,643
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Chizu, will you help her now?
- Uh...</font>

152
00:12:31,188 --> 00:12:32,939
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizu, help me too!</font>

153
00:12:33,565 --> 00:12:35,025
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizu, me next!</font>

154
00:12:37,611 --> 00:12:40,906
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, Kazehaya So... there's another
girl who wants to talk to you, so...</font>

155
00:12:40,989 --> 00:12:44,284
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Seriously? Again?</font>

156
00:12:50,373 --> 00:12:51,541
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No! I'm done!</font>

157
00:12:51,625 --> 00:12:53,084
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What? But Why?!
- What? But Why?!</font>

158
00:12:53,752 --> 00:12:56,588
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So you'll go and help Yumi,
but I'm not worth the effort?!</font>

159
00:12:56,671 --> 00:12:59,925
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're taking her
side, aren't you, Chizu?!</font>

160
00:13:00,008 --> 00:13:03,386
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- W-What a pain in the butt.
- Hey, Chizu, how come? Why?</font>

161
00:13:03,470 --> 00:13:04,387
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait!</font>

162
00:13:05,597 --> 00:13:09,059
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizu didn't do anything wrong! This is
wrong. The girls in our class shouldn't be</font>

163
00:13:09,142 --> 00:13:12,771
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">fighting like this!</font>

164
00:13:12,854 --> 00:13:16,066
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why if it's come to this...</font>

165
00:13:17,234 --> 00:13:20,028
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...It's better if nobody ever asks him out!</font>

166
00:13:27,953 --> 00:13:30,455
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I seriously couldn't care less.</font>

167
00:13:32,749 --> 00:13:35,919
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You're so right!
- Kazehaya belongs to everyone!</font>

168
00:13:37,170 --> 00:13:40,340
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't stress enough how little I care.</font>

169
00:13:42,926 --> 00:13:47,180
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">In the end, the girls were scared of
Kazehaya being taken by someone so they</font>

170
00:13:47,264 --> 00:13:51,852
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">decided it'd be better to unite.</font>

171
00:13:51,935 --> 00:13:55,772
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hmm, How do I explain it? If you were to
ask I wouldn't say she's a bad person. But</font>

172
00:13:55,856 --> 00:13:59,734
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I kinda felt forced to help, y'know...</font>

173
00:14:00,569 --> 00:14:03,989
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I hate it! It's awful! 'So,
yeah I want nothing to do with her!</font>

174
00:14:04,072 --> 00:14:07,534
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, you were taken advantage of, huh?</font>

175
00:14:09,828 --> 00:14:16,334
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hearing your story gave me a clear image
of just the sort of girl Kurumi is. Now</font>

176
00:14:16,418 --> 00:14:20,672
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">then, let's see if things go according
to her plan or if she's met her match.</font>

177
00:14:20,755 --> 00:14:25,093
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Got it!</font>

178
00:14:25,176 --> 00:14:27,846
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- How 'bout we take a little break guys?
- Yeah!</font>

179
00:14:28,388 --> 00:14:30,390
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll be right back. I'm
gonna go buy something to drink.</font>

180
00:14:30,473 --> 00:14:32,475
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, while you're at it,
can you grab me some tea?</font>

181
00:14:32,559 --> 00:14:34,603
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sure thing!</font>

182
00:14:39,941 --> 00:14:42,944
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Do you think you think if I keep working
at it, I could become more like you one</font>

183
00:14:43,028 --> 00:14:46,031
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">day?</font>

184
00:14:47,782 --> 00:14:52,913
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm pretty sure I sounded
completely ridiculous. How embarrassing.</font>

185
00:15:01,046 --> 00:15:01,963
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kuronuma?</font>

186
00:15:06,551 --> 00:15:07,469
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">K-Kazehaya?</font>

187
00:15:13,850 --> 00:15:19,940
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... aw man... I'm the one who called
out to you, but I'm getting nervous.</font>

188
00:15:20,565 --> 00:15:24,194
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait. Kazehaya's nervous?</font>

189
00:15:25,737 --> 00:15:29,115
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's just... we haven't
chatted much recently.</font>

190
00:15:31,868 --> 00:15:34,120
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah, what am I even saying?</font>

191
00:15:34,913 --> 00:15:38,124
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I, I headed this way 'cause I was going
to buy some drinks, and I just happened to</font>

192
00:15:38,208 --> 00:15:41,419
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- see you... that's all!
- I see... This whole time,</font>

193
00:15:41,503 --> 00:15:44,756
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya was nervous too.</font>

194
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:53,723
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well...</font>

195
00:15:55,058 --> 00:16:00,855
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So that must mean... that he's been
worrying over the same things that I have.</font>

196
00:16:07,696 --> 00:16:10,573
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's the first since Ryu's house.</font>

197
00:16:14,077 --> 00:16:15,912
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya...</font>

198
00:16:17,789 --> 00:16:18,915
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You smiled.
- You smiled.</font>

199
00:16:21,710 --> 00:16:26,464
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's been a while since I saw you smile.</font>

200
00:16:28,216 --> 00:16:29,426
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm so glad.</font>

201
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:34,764
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh yeah, Maru's gotten pretty big.</font>

202
00:16:36,641 --> 00:16:38,601
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Like, about this size.
- Wow!</font>

203
00:16:39,978 --> 00:16:44,065
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He's a total rascal, he runs around the
house destroying things like a hurricane.</font>

204
00:16:44,149 --> 00:16:48,278
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Mm-hm! It's about time
we build him a doghouse.</font>

205
00:16:51,531 --> 00:16:52,449
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Aw, Maru...</font>

206
00:16:57,537 --> 00:16:59,080
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You should come visit.</font>

207
00:17:03,334 --> 00:17:07,505
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But when I think about it, Maru does seem
to get really lonely! So I don't know if</font>

208
00:17:07,589 --> 00:17:11,801
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">he'll stay put even if we
do build him a doghouse.</font>

209
00:17:16,765 --> 00:17:19,350
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako, hey!</font>

210
00:17:21,102 --> 00:17:24,272
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kurumizawa!</font>

211
00:17:25,190 --> 00:17:27,233
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"Zawa?"</font>

212
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:32,447
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Kurumizawa... zawa?
- Zawa, zawa... zawa, zawa... zawa, zawa...</font>

213
00:17:33,156 --> 00:17:36,076
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you didn't know? Her
full name's Ume Kurumizawa.</font>

214
00:17:36,159 --> 00:17:39,204
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So Ume is her... first name?</font>

215
00:17:39,287 --> 00:17:43,124
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Yeah. Isn't that right?
- Uh- huh.</font>

216
00:17:43,875 --> 00:17:45,126
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So that's what I should call her.</font>

217
00:17:50,882 --> 00:17:52,217
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, Kurumizawa.</font>

218
00:17:53,009 --> 00:17:58,264
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, then this whole time... he
wasn't calling her by her first name.</font>

219
00:17:58,890 --> 00:18:02,102
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ume Kurumizawa. Her first name's Ume.</font>

220
00:18:05,355 --> 00:18:08,024
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? I think I feel relieved.</font>

221
00:18:10,819 --> 00:18:13,196
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ka...</font>

222
00:18:15,990 --> 00:18:19,953
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya, is it cool if I
borrow Sawako for a second?</font>

223
00:18:20,036 --> 00:18:23,123
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh, sure, I guess.</font>

224
00:18:24,415 --> 00:18:27,043
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It has to be just us
since it's a girl talk.</font>

225
00:18:27,127 --> 00:18:29,754
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Did she say a girl talk?</font>

226
00:18:33,675 --> 00:18:37,804
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's always something. Why do
I keep getting interrupted?</font>

227
00:18:47,856 --> 00:18:54,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, it's a girl talk. I wonder
what she wants to talk to me about.</font>

228
00:18:57,532 --> 00:19:00,702
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">How far are we going to walk though?</font>

229
00:19:00,785 --> 00:19:03,496
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, uh, Kuru...</font>

230
00:19:09,002 --> 00:19:09,919
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, Ume?</font>

231
00:19:10,795 --> 00:19:12,213
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't call me "Ume!"</font>

232
00:19:17,468 --> 00:19:19,762
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kurumi... Just call me that!</font>

233
00:19:21,931 --> 00:19:22,765
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, you got it.</font>

234
00:19:24,559 --> 00:19:26,853
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I see, it's her nickname.</font>

235
00:19:26,936 --> 00:19:32,901
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">For a second, I thought she was
upset with me for being too friendly.</font>

236
00:19:34,944 --> 00:19:39,699
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">To tell you the truth,
there's someone that I like.</font>

237
00:19:40,408 --> 00:19:44,954
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I want him to be my boyfriend, but I'm
not confident enough to take the next step</font>

238
00:19:45,038 --> 00:19:49,584
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">and I was wondering what I should do.
What would you do in this situation?</font>

239
00:19:53,171 --> 00:19:57,217
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">W- What you should do? I
dunno, what SHOULD you do?!</font>

240
00:19:57,884 --> 00:20:02,055
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's depending on me, Ah,
but nothing's coming to mind!</font>

241
00:20:02,138 --> 00:20:06,309
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No, it's... It's just that I'd
like you to help me out, Sawako.</font>

242
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:10,271
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Me? Kurumi's asking for my help?</font>

243
00:20:11,189 --> 00:20:13,233
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Are you sure you want that?</font>

244
00:20:13,316 --> 00:20:16,486
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I just asked you specifically.</font>

245
00:20:16,569 --> 00:20:18,655
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I want it to be you, Sawako!</font>

246
00:20:19,739 --> 00:20:25,286
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't think... I've ever been relied
on like this before. This is huge!</font>

247
00:20:25,370 --> 00:20:28,665
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I'll do my best!
- You'll help me? Thank you!</font>

248
00:20:29,832 --> 00:20:33,836
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But I have no idea
what I'm supposed to do.</font>

249
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:37,382
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll tell you what to do, so
don't worry about that part.</font>

250
00:20:37,465 --> 00:20:40,969
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">... but if I get involved in your love
life, you sure I won't end up ruining the</font>

251
00:20:41,052 --> 00:20:44,931
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- mood or something like that?
- It'll be fine. After all,</font>

252
00:20:45,014 --> 00:20:48,935
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">it's someone you know well.</font>

253
00:20:52,355 --> 00:20:53,273
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya.</font>

254
00:20:57,986 --> 00:21:00,571
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The person I like... it's Kazehaya.</font>

255
00:21:10,456 --> 00:21:11,499
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's... Kazehaya?</font>

256
00:22:27,241 --> 00:22:28,701
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My heart wavers.</font>

257
00:22:29,243 --> 00:22:31,412
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This incomparable feeling.</font>

258
00:22:32,538 --> 00:22:34,499
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "Special?"</font>
